OL,3,GNEWSAGrandad killed in crash had 'heart
OL,4,Aof gold'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a grandad
OL,7,Fwith a "heart of gold" who died in a
OL,8,Fcrash last month.
OL,10,FDavid Reed, 51, was cycling on Nissan
OL,11,FWay in Washington on 11 September when
OL,12,Fhe was in a crash with a black Mercedes
OL,13,FAMG car on 11 September. He died at the
OL,14,Fscene.
OL,16,FHis family described him as "one of the
OL,17,Fkindest, gentlest men you could ever
OL,18,Fmeet, with a heart of gold and an
OL,19,Finfectious laugh" who also was
OL,20,F"Sunderland through and through" with a
OL,21,Fgreat love for his home town football
OL,22,Fclub.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
